存本文明示關係，不由繼位或熟知世系推導；數位見證仍待校勘。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:p001","text":"秦之先，帝顓頊之苗裔。孫曰女修。女修織，玄鳥隕卵，女修吞之，生子大業。大業取少典之子，曰女華。女華生大費，與禹平水土。已成，帝錫玄圭。禹受曰：「非予能成，亦大費為輔。」帝舜曰：「咨爾費，贊禹功，其賜爾皁游。爾後嗣將大出。」乃妻之姚姓之玉女。大費拜受，佐舜調馴鳥獸，鳥獸多馴服，是為柏翳。舜賜姓嬴氏。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m001-0004","start":4,"end":7,"surface":"帝顓頊","kind":"person","person_id":"2to_ofg_fuz","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m001-0013","start":13,"end":15,"surface":"女修","kind":"person","person_id":"bpi_u2n_1py","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m001-0016","start":16,"end":18,"surface":"女修","kind":"person","person_id":"bpi_u2n_1py","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m001-0025","start":25,"end":27,"surface":"女修","kind":"person","person_id":"bpi_u2n_1py","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m001-0032","start":32,"end":34,"surface":"大業","kind":"person","person_id":"f1d_zbt_d2u","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m001-0035","start":35,"end":37,"surface":"大業","kind":"person","person_id":"f1d_zbt_d2u","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m001-0038","start":38,"end":42,"surface":"少典之子","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"氏族、群體或未核定跨卷身份與指代；不補造個人與世代。"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m001-0044","start":44,"end":46,"surface":"女華","kind":"person","person_id":"hil_73x_nk5","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m001-0047","start":47,"end":49,"surface":"女華","kind":"person","person_id":"hil_73x_nk5","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m001-0050","start":50,"end":52,"surface":"大費","kind":"person","person_id":"fd9_3qc_637","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shij